      "value": "detailed_description:\nCinematic first-person POV, photorealistic, ultrawide. Use <Picture 1> for the pet's identity, <Picture 2> for its realistic appearance and snowy landing environment, and <Picture 3> for the icy bridge and wooden cabin.\n\n[Shot 1: 0–3 seconds]\nThe fluffy pet from <Picture 1>, rendered realistically as in <Picture 2>, drops from the sky toward the snowy ground ahead of the viewer. Its pink curls and floppy ears flutter during the fall.\n\n[Shot 2: 3–6 seconds]\nUse the landing composition of <Picture 2>. The pet lands heavily in front of the viewer, throwing up a rolling cloud of loose snow. The powder surges toward the camera and briefly obscures the entire view, concealing the transition.\n\n[Shot 3: 6–15 seconds]\nThe moving snow disperses to reveal the scene from <Picture 3>, matching its icy bridge, rope railings, wooden cabin and mountain background. The viewer smoothly glides forward along the bridge toward the cabin, with gloved hands visible beside the railings. The cabin grows steadily larger. The wooden door swings inward as the viewer approaches, and the camera continues through the doorway into a warmly lit wooden interior.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nWind, a falling whoosh, a muffled landing and rushing snow, followed by continuous scraping on ice and a creaking wooden door. Wind becomes muffled indoors.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
    },
